WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
A Facebook Page, ad account, payment method and required access.

2
00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Open Ads Manager → Create. Match the objective to your goal.

3
00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Choose conversion location, audience, placements, budget and schedule.

4
00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Choose your identity, add creative, copy, destination and a clear CTA.

5
00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Review the destination, tracking, budget and advertising policy rules.

6
00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Meta reviews the ad before it runs. Approval and launch are not instant.
